  "definition": "Voluntary License Surrender When Disciplinary Allegations are Pending",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-05-08",
  "historyNote": "#7871-B, eff 4-14-03; ss by #10004, INTERIM, eff 9-22-11, EXPIRED: 3-20-12 New. #10158, eff 6-27-12 (formerly Acp 220.04); ss by #13578, eff 5-8-23",
